[427.229622, "o", "\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThinking for \u001b[1m5s\u001b[22m… \u001b[38;5;246m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mThere's one issue (#2933) that has \u001b[38;5;153mseverity:must\u001b[39m but it also has \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153mcursor:dispatch\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;5;153mdispatched\u001b[39m labels. The instructions say to filter out \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3missues with these labels: - \"过滤掉标签中包含以下任意一个的 \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B   \u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mIssue：cursor:dispatch, dispatched, auto-triaged, needs-human, wontfix, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mumbrella\" So issue #2933 should be filtered out because it has \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mcursor:dispatch\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;153mdispatched\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;5;153mauto-triaged\u001b[39m labels. That explains why the\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mscript\u001b[13Greturned\u001b[22G\u001b[38;5;153m[]\u001b[39m -\u001b[27Gall\u001b[31Gseverity:must\u001b[45Gissues\u001b[52Gare\u001b[56Galready\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mdispatched/filtered.\u001b[27GThe\u001b[31Gresult\u001b[38Gshows\u001b[44Gno\u001b[47Gpending\u001b[55Gissues\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Gprocess.\u001b[74GLet\u001b[78Gme\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mverify\u001b[13Gby\u001b[16Gchecking\u001b[25Gif\u001b[28Gthere\u001b[34Gare\u001b[38Gmore\u001b[43Gissues\u001b[50Gbeyond\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Ginitial\u001b[69Gquery\u001b[75Glimit.\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;215m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;222m处\u001b[38;5;215m理\u001b[8Gseverity:must\u001b[22GIssues…\u001b[30G\u001b[38;5;246m(1m\u001b[34G21s\u001b[38G·\u001b[40G\u001b[38;5;247mthinking\u001b[49Gwith\u001b[54Ghigh\u001b[59Geffort\u001b[38;5;246m)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;215m◼\u001b[8G\u001b[39m\u001b[1m自动化修复\u001b[19Gseverity:must\u001b[33GIssues\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;210m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gbypass\u001b[13Gpermissions\u001b[25Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42Gcycle)\u001b[49G·\u001b[51Gesc\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Ginterrupt\u001b[68G·\u001b[70Gctrl+t\u001b[77Gt…\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A"]
