[435.283331, "o", "\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mThinking for \u001b[1m2s\u001b[22m… \u001b[38;5;246m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mAs expected, the only \u001b[38;5;153mseverity:must\u001b[39m issue (#2933) has \u001b[38;5;153mcursor:dispatch\u001b[39m, \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153mdispatched\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;5;153mauto-triaged\u001b[39m labels, so it's filtered out. The result is an\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mempty list. Since there are no pending issues to process (the only one is \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B   \u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3malready dispatched), I should output \"NO_ISSUES: 暂无待处理 Issue\" and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mstop.\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;215m✽\u001b[3G处理\u001b[8G\u001b[38;5;222msev\u001b[38;5;215merity:must\u001b[22GIssues…\u001b[30G\u001b[38;5;246m(1m\u001b[34G29s\u001b[38G·\u001b[40G\u001b[38;5;247mthinking\u001b[49Gwith\u001b[54Ghigh\u001b[59Geffort\u001b[38;5;246m)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;215m◼\u001b[8G\u001b[39m\u001b[1m自动化修复\u001b[19Gseverity:must\u001b[33GIssues\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;210m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gbypass\u001b[13Gpermissions\u001b[25Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42Gcycle)\u001b[49G·\u001b[51Gesc\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Ginterrupt\u001b[68G·\u001b[70Gctrl+t\u001b[77Gt…\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A"]
